<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission 97/98 economic forecast for Austria.</title>
<headline>EU Commission 97/98 economic forecast for Austria.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Austria, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 1.6	  2.5</p>
<p> Investment			 5.4	  7.5</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     2.1	  2.0</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	     4.2	  4.1</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  3.0	  2.9</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  68.8	 68.8</p>
</text>
